msgstr "Une page par feuille, orienté verticalement sans rotation."

#: unpaper.py:49
msgid "Double"
msgstr "Double"

#: unpaper.py:51
msgid ""
"Two pages per sheet, landscape orientation (one page on the left half, one "
"page on the right half)."
msgstr ""
"Deux pages par feuille, orientation paysage (une page sur la moitié gauche, "
"une page sur la moitié droite)."

#: unpaper.py:60
msgid "# Output pages"
msgstr "# pages de sortie"

#: unpaper.py:61
